sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant M as SplitOS Manager
    participant UP as Update Orchestration
    participant ID as Identity & Entitlement
    participant CM as Compatibility Management
    participant RH as Runtime Host
    participant PB as Privileged Broker
    participant WIN as Windows/Servicing
    participant BI as Installed Baseline Identity
    participant RC as Recovery Coordination

    U->>M: Check / Apply update
    M->>UP: Discover update
    UP->>ID: Check update entitlement
    ID-->>UP: Entitlement result
    UP->>CM: Evaluate target compatibility
    CM-->>UP: Compatibility decision

    alt Not entitled or incompatible
        UP-->>M: Not applicable / blocked
    else Applicable
        UP->>RH: Acquire major mutation window
        RH-->>UP: Granted / deferred
        UP->>UP: Create durable UpdateTransaction
        UP->>PB: Apply privileged update operations
        PB->>WIN: Servicing/update mechanism
        WIN-->>PB: Technical result
        PB-->>UP: Technical result

        opt Reboot required
            UP->>UP: Persist transaction state
            Note over WIN,UP: Reboot / runtime resumes transaction
        end

        UP->>WIN: Read actual target state
        WIN-->>UP: Version/runtime/baseline evidence
        UP->>CM: Verify target compatibility/health
        CM-->>UP: Verification result

        alt Verification passed
            UP->>BI: Commit target baseline/release identity
            UP-->>M: UPDATE_COMPLETED
        else Apply/verification failed
            UP->>RC: Start recovery with failed transaction
            RC->>BI: Read source baseline identity
            BI-->>RC: Last committed baseline
            RC->>WIN: Observe current actual state
            WIN-->>RC: Recovery evidence
            RC->>PB: Apply recovery target
            PB->>WIN: Privileged recovery operations
            WIN-->>PB: Technical result
            RC->>WIN: Re-read actual state
            WIN-->>RC: Actual recovery state
            alt Recovery verified
                RC-->>RH: Release mutation window / stable startup path
                RC-->>M: RECOVERY_COMPLETED
            else Recovery incomplete
                RC-->>M: SAFE_FALLBACK / USER_ACTION_REQUIRED
            end
        end
    end